# Normalize line endings: this repo generates artifacts (schemas/*.json) and
# byte-compares them in tests/CI. CRLF checkouts (windows autocrlf) would make
# the emitted-LF vs checked-out-CRLF comparison report false drift.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets (none yet, but explicit is safer than accidental conversion).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
